Z||000000||Leadfoot||09-16-2001||09:47 PM||||That's right.  It was so easy...but a lot of busy work.  I ran the wires as the Helm book shows.  The hardest problem I had was wiring up the sub amp with my din and 1/2 pioneer.  After a quick search on the forum I found what I needed.  You guys rock!!  The power windows kinda work.  The switch is bad and the right side mirror only goes up and down.  I guess the left-right motor is toast.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  The guy I bought them from said they would work.  O well you can't win them all.  I had some time to kill before the sun went down so I purged/bled my clutch system and painted my rear calipers yellow.  Not a bad days work. (patting myself I my shoulder....oops a little too hard....broke my shoulder blade.)  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  ||||reg||1
