Z||000002||Carrolles||09-17-2001||08:13 AM||||Your mirror problem is most likely the switch.  The contacts get corroded pretty easily due to lack of use.<P>I've taken them apart several times and cleaned the contacts with good results but there is a very delicate plastic post with a clip on it that holds the assembly together.  This post is very easy to break.||||reg||1
