Z||000005||88CoupeV6||09-17-2001||10:28 AM||||I did the same swap for the windows, and a homemade 8"sub setup in the stock spot. Did you take the dash out to run the wires in the stock location? I think that was the hardest part. I used screws instead of rivets for the door motors too. I didn't know where to find huge rivets like that. what did you use?<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
