Z||000007||Leadfoot||09-17-2001||10:57 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>I did the same swap for the windows, and a homemade 8"sub setup in the stock spot. Did you take the dash out to run the wires in the stock location? <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I stripped down the whole interior from the headliner to the dash.  It really isn't that bad.  All you need is a torx (forgot the size), a 10mm socket, phillips, flat head screw driver (to pop those annoying cab clamps) and a 7mm socket.<P>||||reg||1
